# Secrets
credential*.json
# ...except the placeholder template, which is meant to be committed as a setup reference
!credential_tmp.json

# Runtime/scratch folders (prefixed with "_") — ignore everything generated or
# dropped in by a user at runtime; keep only the few files that ship as part of
# the skill itself (the fill-in template, the output-folder doc).
_input/*
!_input/brief.template.md
_output/*
!_output/README.md
_log/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
